{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55336","headline":"至安陆竺乾盛会 · 归晓","name":"至安陆竺乾盛会","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有时途路上，见□□□□。\n野□有霜宿，孤峰无水斋。\n白云随步步，黄叶落挨挨。\n若遇杉松里，风寒□碧崖。\n（《八琼室金石补正》卷八六收潘平撰《大宋襄州凤山延庆禅院传法惠广大师寿塔碑铭》引。\n）（按：此诗爲其入宋前作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"归晓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}